199
00:07:14,252 --> 00:07:16,288
and stopped holding back supply when

200
00:07:16,288 --> 00:07:17,793
demand was weak.

201
00:07:17,993 --> 00:07:20,193
It agreed to phase out selling Russia's

202
00:07:20,193 --> 00:07:21,233
diamonds.

203
00:07:21,433 --> 00:07:22,689
By two thousand three,

204
00:07:22,689 --> 00:07:24,605
its share of the market had fallen

205
00:07:24,605 --> 00:07:26,483
