211
00:07:34,717 --> 00:07:36,877
But the biggest threat did not come

212
00:07:36,877 --> 00:07:38,827
from a mine at all.

213
00:07:38,847 --> 00:07:41,156
It came from a laboratory.

214
00:07:46,817 --> 00:07:49,753
What happens to forever when anyone can

215
00:07:49,753 --> 00:07:51,421
make a diamond?

216
00:07:55,817 --> 00:07:58,764
Diamonds can now be grown in factories,

217
00:07:58,764 --> 00:08:00,926
with the same carbon and the same

218
00:08:00,926 --> 00:08:01,987
