226
00:08:13,906 --> 00:08:15,276
different product,

227
00:08:15,276 --> 00:08:17,734
not a rival to the real thing.

228
00:08:17,983 --> 00:08:18,808
At first,

229
00:08:18,808 --> 00:08:21,938
