230
00:08:21,938 --> 00:08:22,823
goods.

231
00:08:23,013 --> 00:08:25,384
As De Beers' chief executive Al Cook

232
00:08:25,384 --> 00:08:26,546
later put it,

233
00:08:26,546 --> 00:08:28,183
back in twenty eighteen,

234
00:08:28,183 --> 00:08:30,554
synthetics were selling for thousands of

235
00:08:30,554 --> 00:08:31,242
dollars,

236
00:08:31,242 --> 00:08:34,213
