239
00:08:38,983 --> 00:08:42,283
Then the price of lab diamonds collapsed.

240
00:08:42,283 --> 00:08:43,852
According to De Beers,

241
00:08:43,852 --> 00:08:46,807
wholesale prices for lab-grown jewellery

