252
00:09:06,627 --> 00:09:08,443
Here is the price line of a

253
00:09:08,443 --> 00:09:09,714
stone from the ground,

254
00:09:09,714 --> 00:09:12,048
held up by scarcity and by a

255
00:09:12,048 --> 00:09:13,167
story.

256
00:09:13,567 --> 00:09:15,044
Here is the line of a lab

257
00:09:15,044 --> 00:09:15,656
diamond,

258
00:09:15,656 --> 00:09:18,367
falling towards its cost of production.

259
00:09:18,397 --> 00:09:19,481
Every year,

260
00:09:19,481 --> 00:09:21,252
the gap between them is the price

261
00:09:21,252 --> 00:09:22,737
of the story.

262
00:09:22,887 --> 00:09:25,026
The question for the industry is how

263
00:09:25,026 --> 00:09:27,338
long people will keep paying for it.

264
00:09:27,583 --> 00:09:30,011
And then the numbers reached the owner

265
00:09:30,011 --> 00:09:31,339
of De Beers.

266
00:09:36,983 --> 00:09:40,499
What is the diamond king worth today?

267
00:09:45,983 --> 00:09:47,559
In twenty eleven,

268
00:09:47,559 --> 00:09:50,299
the mining group Anglo American paid the

269
00:09:50,299 --> 00:09:53,039
Oppenheimer family five point one billion

270
00:09:53,039 --> 00:09:55,923
dollars for forty percent of De Beers.

271
00:09:55,953 --> 00:09:57,947
That put a value of almost thirteen

272
00:09:57,947 --> 00:10:00,983
