275
00:10:05,783 --> 00:10:07,359
Fifteen years later,

276
00:10:07,359 --> 00:10:10,363
the story was very different.

277
00:10:10,463 --> 00:10:13,081
In its results for twenty twenty-five,

278
00:10:13,081 --> 00:10:16,444
Anglo American booked an impairment of two

279
00:10:16,444 --> 00:10:18,822
point three billion dollars on De Beers,

280
00:10:18,822 --> 00:10:21,343
