281
00:10:21,523 --> 00:10:23,085
It is now trying to sell the

282
00:10:23,085 --> 00:10:24,354
business.

283
00:10:24,617 --> 00:10:26,775
In July twenty twenty-six,

284
00:10:26,775 --> 00:10:29,201
Bloomberg reported that Anglo was in

285
00:10:29,201 --> 00:10:31,383
advanced talks to sell its stake to

286
00:10:31,383 --> 00:10:33,323
a group led by a former De

287
00:10:33,323 --> 00:10:34,997
Beers chief executive,

288
00:10:34,997 --> 00:10:37,487
for about one billion dollars.

289
00:10:37,487 --> 00:10:39,381
Anglo did not confirm the figure,

290
00:10:39,381 --> 00:10:41,103
and said it was not exclusive with

291
00:10:41,103 --> 00:10:42,277
any buyer.

292
00:10:42,397 --> 00:10:44,022
But even as a rough guide,

293
00:10:44,022 --> 00:10:45,807
the gap is enormous.

294
00:10:45,807 --> 00:10:47,650
Almost thirteen billion dollars,

295
00:10:47,650 --> 00:10:48,377
then.

296
00:10:48,377 --> 00:10:50,031
Perhaps one billion,

297
00:10:50,031 --> 00:10:50,912
now.

298
00:10:51,150 --> 00:10:53,728
So what is the lesson of De

299
00:10:53,728 --> 00:10:54,650
Beers?

300
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:56,738
That a price is not only about

301
00:10:56,738 --> 00:10:58,630
how rare something is.

302
00:10:58,660 --> 00:11:01,128
It is about who controls the supply,

303
00:11:01,128 --> 00:11:03,540
and what story people believe.

304
00:11:03,830 --> 00:11:06,650
De Beers mastered both for a century.

305
00:11:06,660 --> 00:11:08,199
It held the stones back,

306
00:11:08,199 --> 00:11:10,360
and it gave them a meaning.

307
00:11:10,500 --> 00:11:12,670
The slogan still works.

308
00:11:12,730 --> 00:11:14,968
But a story can only hold a

309
00:11:14,968 --> 00:11:16,957
price up for as long as people

310
00:11:16,957 --> 00:11:18,946
stop asking what the thing would cost

311
00:11:18,946 --> 00:11:20,292
without it.

312
00:11:20,550 --> 00:11:23,041
Next time on The Hidden Economics,

313
00:11:23,041 --> 00:11:26,012
we follow the money behind another hidden

314
00:11:26,012 --> 00:11:28,440
link of the world economy.

315
00:11:28,660 --> 00:11:31,181
This is The Hidden Economics.
